      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_d5aad3eb",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: bitch..; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image features a vintage black-and-white photograph of a woman with a pensive or disdainful expression, juxtaposed with highly derogatory text. The text reads 'bitch..' at the top and 'shut your ugly crack addict looking, poor white trash ass up' at the bottom. This combination uses explicit, vulgar language to insult the woman's appearance and socioeconomic status, targeting her as a 'white trash' individual with a 'crack addict' look. The meme's intent is to demean and insult the subject through crude, offensive language, fitting the definition of an abusive meme. The visual of the woman is used to amplify the insult, creating a confrontational and hostile tone. The overall intent is to provoke a negative emotional reaction and to degrade the subject based on appearance and assumed lifestyle, which aligns with abusive intent as it threatens and abuses the individual depicted.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_54a61e0c"
      },
