      "description": "A scene composed of a woman and overlaid text, where the text delivers a highly derogatory and abusive insult directed at the woman. The woman is depicted in a vintage black-and-white photograph, seated and looking at the camera with a pensive or disdainful expression. The text, positioned at the top and bottom of the image, uses vulgar language to demean her appearance and socioeconomic status, targeting her as a 'white trash' individual with a 'crack addict' look. The visual of the woman is juxtaposed with the insulting text to amplify the degradation, creating a confrontational and hostile tone.",
