      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "racism",
      "label": "Racism",
      "description": "Prejudice, discrimination, or antagonism directed against individuals or groups based on their race or ethnicity. The term 'white trash' is a racialized slur that implies inferiority based on race and class, and its use in the meme reflects a racist framework that devalues people based on their perceived racial and socioeconomic status.",
