      "description": "The use of offensive, crude, or taboo language to insult or demean someone. The text 'shut your ugly crack addict looking, poor white trash ass up' is filled with vulgar and explicit language designed to provoke and degrade, which is a common feature of abusive memes and reflects a broader cultural pattern of using profanity to assert dominance or insult.",
