      "description": "A category of internet memes that use explicit, vulgar, or threatening language to insult, demean, or harass individuals or groups. These memes often rely on stereotypes, prejudice, and degrading language to provoke emotional reactions and are considered harmful and offensive. The meme in question fits this category due to its explicit insults and hostile tone.",
